name: sim.auxiliaryConsoleClose
description: Closes an auxiliary console window
luaSynopsis: int result = sim.auxiliaryConsoleClose(int consoleHandle)
pythonSynopsis: int result = sim.auxiliaryConsoleClose(int consoleHandle)
inputs:
1. consoleHandle: handle of the console window, previously returned by sim.auxiliaryConsoleOpen
outputs:
1. result: 0 if the console doesn't exist (anymore), in which case no error is generated. 1 if the console window was closed
